# A wrong password: the network refuses the join, and says so.
@wifi badauth
@debug
say "^Press a key" 100
key x
key o
say "^WARN  Gate overridden" 100
sayn 2 "^Press a key" 300
key w
say "^Starting the radio chip" 100
say "^  Booster's network EmuMD, -45 dBm \(good\)" 3000
nosay "^  Joined"
say "^FAIL  The network refused the password" 100
say "^  EmuMD: wrong password" 100
say "^Enter the Wi-Fi password again in Booster" 100
